@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Usulan: satu daftar status kerja, Path = dropdown
left to right direction
state "New" as S1 #dde6fa
state "Attempted\nto Contact" as S2 #dde6fa
state "Connected" as S3 #cfe3ff
state "Qualifying" as S4 #cfe3ff
state "Converted" as C #dff4ea
state "Lost" as L #fde8e6
[*] --> S1 : lead masuk
S1 -[#122e7c,bold]-> S2
S2 -[#122e7c,bold]-> S3
S3 -[#122e7c,bold]-> S4
S4 -[#0a7a54,bold]-> C : Convert
S2 -[#122e7c,dashed]-> S1 : boleh mundur
S3 -[#122e7c,dashed]-> S2
S4 -[#122e7c,dashed]-> S3
S1 -[#b42318]-> L
S2 -[#b42318]-> L
S3 -[#b42318]-> L
S4 -[#b42318]-> L : Mark as Lost\n(alasan wajib)
L -[#122e7c,dashed]-> S3 : Buka kembali
legend bottom
  Biru muda = status kerja (aktif). Urutan dan nama diatur tenant.
  Mundur antar status kerja boleh dan tidak butuh alasan. Hanya Lost yang butuh alasan.
  Keluar dari New butuh Owner (lead di Queue belum bisa dikerjakan).
endlegend
@enduml
